          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Group 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.251,
            0.269,
            0.273
          ],
          "content": "**Group 2**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.337,
            0.522,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "So, the share of each child is the same in both these situations!"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.557,
            0.334,
            0.635,
            0.382
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_16_image_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.663,
            0.329,
            0.77,
            0.36
          ],
          "content": "So, 25 = 10 4 !"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.416,
            0.822,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": "Let us examine the shares of each child in the following situations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.439,
            0.634,
            0.46
          ],
          "content": "• 1 roti is divided equally between 2 children."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.462,
            0.641,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": "• 2 rotis are divided equally among 4 children."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.485,
            0.642,
            0.506
          ],
          "content": "• 3 rotis are divided equally among 6 children."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.517,
            0.365,
            0.537
          ],
          "content": "Let us draw and share!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.537,
            0.834,
            0.584
          ],
          "content": "Did you notice that in each situation the share of every child is the same? So, we can say that $\\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{2}{4} \\leq \\frac{3}{6}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.613,
            0.278,
            0.653
          ],
          "content": "1 roti is divided equally between 2"
        },
        {
